; Claude: MiniCampaigns: a retail multiplayer co-op campaign as a single-player campaign (docs/MINI_CAMPAIGNS.md).
; The other players' ships are flown by the AI. Missions and branching as retail.
$Name: FS1 Coop: The Last Hope
$Type: single
+Description:
The Hope is the most beloved destroyer of the Vasudan people.  In the final days of the Shivan war, it and its crew performed its most amazing operations.  This is the story of these operations.  This is the last story of Vasuda Prime.
$end_multi_text

